{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"a17b9e98424b5e8336d3c8fa5b7c05e9d1f4a145ca73b5b013a1d8113dabe247","slug":"land-cover-thematic-accuracy","location":"/content/indicators/land_cover_thematic_accuracy.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Land Cover Thematic Accuracy","content_includes_title":false,"numbering":{"title":{"offset":2}},"thumbnail":"/oqapi-jupyter-book/en/build/landbedeck_thematisc-b7ffa980936296bceec1fcee1f7c0fa3.png","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"land_cover_thematic_accuracy.md","url":"/oqapi-jupyter-book/en/build/land_cover_thematic_-f82999ab78b2ff26b546b120a939688a.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"This indicator assesses the agreement between OSM land cover data and the CORINE Land Cover (CLC)\ndataset.\nIt can be applied either to all CLC classes together, or to individual selected classes.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"ebzWXXuVG0"}],"key":"qhDmZ0oskx"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"For the defined area of interest, the polygons resulting from the intersection of OSM and CLC data\nare aggregated in a confusion matrix. From this, we calculate class-level and overall accuracy\nmetrics, including precision, recall and the F1 score. All metrics are area-weighted, so that the\nspatial extent of the polygons is taken into account rather than treating features as equally\nweighted units. This approach allows for a systematic assessment of the thematic consistency of\nOSM land cover data compared with the referenced CLC data.","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"DDGydEVHtw"}],"key":"QvHuWguilP"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"note","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note","key":"zVBvXE4CEr"}],"key":"IAKvJnJ7qX"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"For this indicator, an attribute must be chosen in addition to the topic. A field for selecting\nthe attribute appears below the indicator selection (see figure). The indicator can be calculated\neither for a single attribute or for all attributes at once. For the latter, leave the field empty.","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"ljhVH6wSvy"}],"key":"p4EYxX8iNv"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/oqapi-jupyter-book/en/build/landbedeck_thematisc-b7ffa980936296bceec1fcee1f7c0fa3.png","width":300,"key":"nlloYmVloR","urlSource":"../../abbildungen/landbedeck_thematisch_dropdown.png"}],"key":"f00yLL2Y5A"}],"key":"BcrQEZYdvb"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The result value is calculated as an area-weighted F1 score, normalised to a range of 0 to 1.\nValues below 0.6 are considered low thematic agreement, values between 0.6 and 0.85 medium\nagreement, and values above 0.85 high agreement between OSM and CLC.","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"key":"vquBsIdl2r"}],"key":"vII25cCxQ7"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"attention","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Attention","key":"ENAdInyr1s"}],"key":"eqXzUl2ATZ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"This indicator is only available for the topic ","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"key":"o5eXJtwmtq"},{"type":"emphasis","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Land Use and Land Cover","position":{"start":{"line":29,"